8F0 (D3D12Core.dll) in godot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe: 0xC0000005: Access violation reading location 0x0000018228B68D1F.\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nImport some music files and listen to them in the importer until the program crashes.\n\nI'm not sure whether it's tied to a specific file type (I used OGG) or a specific duration (the ones I was listening to were a couple minutes) but I was able to get a crash within 30 seconds with a single audio file (see attached MRP).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[audio-crash-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23784964/audio-crash-test.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113223/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113223/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}